  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 3.2,
      "end": 9.72,
      "text": "welcome back as i said this is our long sprint zone you can see i start with a pretty monster pull here i think it's like a minute and a half"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.66,
      "end": 22.42,
      "text": "that's where i kind of chip in and i'm like diego let's get it going we were going too slow after my pull we kind of started to slow down so we started passing people"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.14,
      "end": 33.28,
      "text": "and then we kind of just let things loose where it's it's down to the four of us diego is out of frame, he's off the front a little bit here, and then we roll in."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.1,
      "end": 83.76,
      "text": "yeah, this is our long sprint zone, as i said, kind of opened it with a little ripper here, we're about a minute, a minute and a half on the front, and then we don't really let it rip. i mean, we've got a headwind, so we're really, really pushing to just kind of get past these guys. after our pulls, we got kind of washed to the back, but now we're back in the front. we kind of let things fall apart. i think diego's behind me here, but it's the four of us in the front. and then, yeah, we just let it rip. i tossed down an attack at the end and managed to pull through."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.32,
      "end": 89.58,
      "text": "and just look at that face. oh my gosh, diego is cooked. what a great sprint zone."
    }
  ],
